<title>BELGIUM: Belgian money market supply held steady in week.</title>
<headline>Belgian money market supply held steady in week.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian central bank said it held money market liquidity little changed in the week to April 21. (figures from the weekly statement in bln francs) -</p>
<p> Foreign currency reserves	   443.181 ( + 1.405)</p>
<p> Advances against pledged security  16.451 ( + 0.169)</p>
<p> Commercial bills			  2.515 ( + 0.025)</p>
<p> Securities portfolio		   23.812 ( - 0.001)</p>
<p> Money market interventions*	 101.820 ( - 0.030)</p>
<p> Bank notes in circulation	   460.673 ( + 1.306)</p>
<p>* comprises repurchase agreements and interbank loans</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
